          <unicode>ᠳᠤᠷᠭᠠᠵᠤ ᠠᠪᠤᠭᠰᠠᠨ ᠮᠥᠩᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>argent de l'amende</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
